cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "UK Collision Severity Prediction"
abstract: "A supervised machine learning pipeline classifying UK road collision
  severity (Fatal / Serious / Slight) using STATS19 data published by the UK
  Department for Transport (2020–2024). The pipeline retrieves data exclusively
  from TU Wien DBRepo REST API and documents the full experiment with FAIR
  metadata standards (RO-Crate, CodeMeta, FAIR4ML, Croissant, Model Card)."
